sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Badge reader
    participant C as Controller
    participant S as Access server
    participant M as Motor
    B->>C: badge number
    C->>S: is badge allowed?
    alt allow
        S-->>C: allow
        C->>M: release lock, open
        M-->>C: fully open
    else deny
        S-->>C: deny
        C->>B: red light
    else no answer within 2 s
        Note over C: treated as deny
        C->>B: red light
